+  `weather=clear|overcast|mist|rain`, or the terms `cloud`, `wet`, `rain`, `mist` (0..1). Cloud blends the sky towards
+  an overcast sky and dims the sun; wetness darkens porous surfaces and adds a water film (terrain, foliage, skin,
+  cloth, kit, structures); rain adds puddles on level ground and rain streaks; mist thickens a low height fog.
