+## Visual critic iteration 1 (stage polish1)
+
+The eleven ranked issues of the visual critic's first pass over the benchmark scenes, worked most visible first:
+meadow terrain, cascade shadow acne, crowd idles, faces, hero-beat staging, fill light, the land beyond the map,
+standards, smoke, settlements and water, rain. Presentation only (DR42): nothing reads back into the simulation and the
+battle trace is read-only. What changed, before/after per issue, llvmpipe costs, tests and what still looks
