+**Algorithms implemented from publications or common practice** (no code copied, no asset): receiver-plane depth bias
+for shadow-map filtering (Isidoro, "Shadow Mapping: GPU-based Tips and Techniques", GDC 2006), value noise with analytic
+derivatives (common practice), a forward-scattering transmission lobe for hair (after the TT lobe of Marschner et al.
+2003, simplified), a sunlit Lambert ground as the lower hemisphere of the sky light (common practice), cloth flutter as
+travelling sine waves with analytic normals (common practice).
